# The prolate kernel of particle mesh Ewald (D[prolate-ewald]) over the
# particles of a nonzero charge (D262), on the host:
# - tri-alanine in 1,218 OPC waters (examples/ala3), whose oxygens carry no
#   charge: three quarters of the particles are listed, and a device
#   gathers every particle (gather_all);
# - the same with every other water uncharged
#   (Inputs/zero_water_charges.py), 1,860 of 4,905 particles, which a
#   device gathers over the list;
# - the rhombic dodecahedron of prolate-triclinic.test with 203 of its 403
#   waters uncharged (SOLZ), gathered over the list in a triclinic cell.
# The runs cross segments of checkpoints with spatial_order, where
# md_exec.nonzero makes the list again. The rows at the start and after
# each segment are those of the prolate kernel without a list (ae3b5382,
# before D262) to the digits of the log, as the states are to the bit
# (compared with mdir checkpoint on PR #337, in double and mixed
# precision). prolate-skip-zero-gpu.test runs the same on a device.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
# RUN: cp %S/../../examples/ala3/ala3.prmtop %S/../../examples/ala3/ala3.inpcrd %S/Inputs/triclinic/dodecahedron.gro %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/zero_water_charges.py %t/ala3.prmtop %t/half.prmtop | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=COUNT
# RUN: sed 's/ala3.prmtop/half.prmtop/; s/ala3.h5/half.h5/' %t/ala3.toml > %t/half.toml
# RUN: cd %t && mdir emit ala3.toml --stage=module | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MODULE
# RUN: cd %t && mdir emit half.toml --stage=module | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HALF-MODULE
# RUN: cd %t && mdir run ala3.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DOUBLE
# RUN: cd %t && mdir run half.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HALF
# RUN: cd %t && mdir emit dodec.toml --stage=module | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HALF-MODULE
# RUN: cd %t && mdir run dodec.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DODEC

# COUNT: 1860 of 4905 particles charged

# MODULE: md.reciprocal %x, %p_q, %cell, %t_pme_moduli listed(%p_pme_listed)
# MODULE-NEXT: prolate gather_all{{$}}
# HALF-MODULE: md.reciprocal %x, %p_q, %cell, %t_pme_moduli listed(%p_pme_listed)
# HALF-MODULE-NEXT: prolate{{$}}

# DOUBLE: INFO: {{ *}}0 {{ *}}0.0000 {{ *}}-10338.1234 {{ *}}-12540.0451 {{ *}}2201.9217 {{ *}}300.0000 {{ *}}-4466.6375 {{ *}}-27.2687 {{ *}}-10338.1234 {{ *}}52632.8855 {{ *}}1400.8698
