# DOUBLE: INFO: {{ *}}40 {{ *}}0.0800 {{ *}}-10361.0305 {{ *}}-12926.8675 {{ *}}2565.8370 {{ *}}351.5765 {{ *}}-6274.2497 {{ *}}-478.0770 {{ *}}-10343.5119 {{ *}}52524.6891 {{ *}}1398.9493
