# HALF: INFO: {{ *}}40 {{ *}}0.0800 {{ *}}248.4313 {{ *}}-4036.2508 {{ *}}4284.6821 {{ *}}584.9318 {{ *}}9276.9343 {{ *}}7612.5038 {{ *}}565.3454 {{ *}}53659.7126 {{ *}}1419.0310
